      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, just a curiosity, but do the logs say anything? \"Game crashes every 30mins\" is not much to go on for fixing a bug.\n\nFor the GPT partition format, that seems a bit odd, VRChat client itself is a gigabyte, and by default it limits itself to 30 gigs for the cache. \n\nBut yeah, check the logs from VRChat and maybe also the event log in windows, \n\nAlso could check like dxdiag to see how recent your graphics drivers are. Although every time it's been that, VRChat crashes way more frequently for me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
