  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello, VRChat Team, \n\nLately, I am facing an issue playing on my VR headset in PCVR mode. After almost 30 minutes of playing, the game crashed but works in desktop mode. I've done some trouble-shooting, even hearing of a possible cure whereby a GPT format would fix the disk corruption, but the solution wipes all my data, and that won't suit my little data plan. \n\nIt is seriously bothering me in so many ways because I can't enjoy PCVR VRChat, which is a huge part of my gaming experience. I would really appreciate a patch or fix for this so that I can play without interruptions. \n\nThank you for your time and. I Hope this patch soon coming!",
